5d9f-83d7-ff21b4bd2dc1" :question/math-academy-id "q-65612" :question/problem "$\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡{48}^{∘}}{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘}}=$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={24}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot {24}^{∘})=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{24}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘}\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies as\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{48}^{∘}=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{24}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nDividing both sides by $2\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡{48}^{∘}}{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘}} & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡{24}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘}}{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{24}^{∘}\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘}}}{\\cancel{2}\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡{24}^{∘}}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡{24}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65612/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5f9683d9-05b9-5a42-9f81-0170a15dfac1"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65612"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-327763/field-1/a53a456584e4b2a8a9c806008ab2b365d8e4b96a9ec958dce002c913c7483fb8" :answer/id #uuid "88fa1ab4-35d1-5314-8020-820dde48504f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{7\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186256278 :answer-field/choices ["q-327763/field-1/a53a456584e4b2a8a9c806008ab2b365d8e4b96a9ec958dce002c913c7483fb8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-76643/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer/id #uuid "f3b19169-3466-5900-902d-ad5cc8aa1fea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76643/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "ea32ee4d-0d79-586d-af22-caa09e9d2fef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76643/selection/2ba67ff54273661460eaa0e3e45c1c4442f0b6f49f7edadb98be753769c4c9a1" :answer/id #uuid "e5ea7471-653d-593b-ab4a-dbb4fa01c82e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76643/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" :answer/id #uuid "4759e6f6-1b41-5d6d-8479-53f714647ddf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76643/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "885216ae-9057-5aba-b8bb-4930d0ba5142" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-76643/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7465ba39-8e25-5c6d-8bfd-1c2bd409b395" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-76643/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" :answer-field/choices ["q-76643/selection/99f48c1b72e8eeab33eba2584ff0661456642ba13c82a72d98a76e8e1a07563e" "q-76643/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-76643/selection/2ba67ff54273661460eaa0e3e45c1c4442f0b6f49f7edadb98be753769c4c9a1" "q-76643/selection/2edf353dc47d221855e5e7ee4be942392390ff01766e089c29dc368c2051b12d" "q-76643/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-76643" :question/id #uuid "278ccf61-185b-5071-877e-b29360496fc1" :question/math-academy-id "q-76643" :question/problem "Find the exact value of $\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})=\\frac{1}{4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})}=\\frac{1}{4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-76643/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4c898bbf-004c-5905-a0a0-761adefc8bd8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76643"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-24788"] :question/problem "Find the exact value of ${(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}))}^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parenthesis and use the Pythagorean identity.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}))}^{2} & ={sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})+{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =[{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})+{cos}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})]-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =1-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{12}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}) & =1-(\\frac{1}{2})=\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n{(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{12}))}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-24781/selection/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" :answer/id #uuid "09620807-7fce-52f8-bf4c-775e9549662b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24781/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "3ada3d25-7168-56a9-acce-36cef20c5b52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24781/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "42cb2a7c-a995-5499-9701-3347f8f58a6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24781/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "b70159ab-5d3a-5bf3-8c8f-7eaf39e2cea2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24781/selection/2ba67ff54273661460eaa0e3e45c1c4442f0b6f49f7edadb98be753769c4c9a1" :answer/id #uuid "a2c30caa-ff10-53b7-8fdd-aaf6f63bd0cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-24781/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "bb925e20-c96e-5be1-8f73-b15a5af78f02" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-24781/selection/2ba67ff54273661460eaa0e3e45c1c4442f0b6f49f7edadb98be753769c4c9a1" :answer-field/choices ["q-24781/selection/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" "q-24781/selection/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" "q-24781/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-24781/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-24781/selection/2ba67ff54273661460eaa0e3e45c1c4442f0b6f49f7edadb98be753769c4c9a1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-24781" :question/id #uuid "234c5140-a4ed-5ffc-884a-a3cb29eba9e1" :question/math-academy-id "q-24781" :question/problem "Find the exact value of $\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{8}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{8}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-24781/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4c898bbf-004c-5905-a0a0-761adefc8bd8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-24781"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-328087/field-1/34d6a116cfea25ad11008d41d6152ee565691a4dc671039515875488f5520d96" :answer/id #uuid "fd9685f1-7011-5e7c-ad95-1d98e4e0e37d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328087/field-1/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "5310f57c-7f95-566e-ab96-bfd3321a80cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-328087/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "39225043-f2d9-5a43-af04-a30bed00f209" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-328087/field-1/34d6a116cfea25ad11008d41d6152ee565691a4dc671039515875488f5520d96" :answer-field/choices ["q-328087/field-1/34d6a116cfea25ad11008d41d6152ee565691a4dc671039515875488f5520d96" "q-328087/field-1/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-328087" :question/id #uuid "7df0fa64-e505-5b6a-8722-426dd8a2b855" :question/math-academy-id "q-328087" :question/problem "Find the exact value of $\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{24}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{7\\pi }{24})\n$$\n\nwhich simplifies as\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12}).\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})} & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})}{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{24})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the double-angle formula once more with $x=\\frac{7\\pi }{12}$, we can further simplify the above expression: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})} & =\\frac{2\\cdot 2}{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{12})} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{7\\pi }{12})} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{6})} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{(-\\frac{1}{2})} \\\\  & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-328087/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d820aa9f-7c02-53b5-9b09-c25ee59dbdaf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-328087"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-76660/selection/c087f5dc559272d193745a4428553203b94404f681d8529e6e619348c0528d10" :answer/id #uuid "ad716ce1-ffd1-540b-ba09-2028b169bd81" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{