\pi }{7})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{7})\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{7})=$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{7}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{7})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{7})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{7})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{7}).\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{7})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{7})\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{7}) & =3\\cdot [2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{7})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{7})]\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{7}) \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{7})\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{7})} \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-76660/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d820aa9f-7c02-53b5-9b09-c25ee59dbdaf"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-76660"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186257401 :question/answer-fields 17592186274364] {:db/id "q-120087/selection/ma-v1/4ec10c0a44d0cda23f26bdfa8afdf12bb441fce01a5ed4cb6685fe1d57f0e57c/c77855a45362d9bc5d7851d27f974576c82e1d391c8869612ef87e05a2d409d1" :answer/id #uuid "87b71c19-e177-51d2-93c0-34a482735607" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡({75}^{∘})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120087/selection/ma-v1/4ec10c0a44d0cda23f26bdfa8afdf12bb441fce01a5ed4cb6685fe1d57f0e57c/4280bcd0914e40dbdc039bc97ee5d5baafd2654e75e9b692316d9c28c4842856" :answer/id #uuid "baab2cc7-b73f-581a-b668-78f06150370b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120087/selec